    "faq_Qn9hTm": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_T3tKA6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "does mōmi guarantee its products?",
            "content": "<p>Our products are guaranteed to be free of defects in material and workmanship for thirty days from the date of purchase when used as recommended. If your product is defective, we will replace it at our expense. At our option, we may issue a refund instead.</p><p>The mōmi nipple’s soft silicone is not intended to be used as a teething toy. Allowing a baby to gnaw or chew on the nipple excessively may cause the nipple to wear out sooner than expected. Wear and tear caused by excessive gnawing and chewing is not covered by our warranty.</p><p>Our warranty applies only to new products purchased directly from our website or from another authorized reseller.  We cannot guarantee the authenticity, safety, or performance of products purchased used or from unauthorized sellers.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_cbXnfy": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "does mōmi offer financing or payment plans?",
            "content": "<p>We are pleased to offer payment plans on the purchase of eligible items from our store through our partnerships with Paypal and Affirm. Look for the Paypal and Affirm icons at checkout to divide your purchase into 4 interest-free payments. </p><p>Visit <a href=\"https://www.affirm.com/how-it-works\" title=\"https://www.affirm.com/how-it-works\">Affirm</a> for full payment terms and disclosure requirements.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_b8Q6bL": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "what is mōmi’s return policy?",
            "content": "<ul><li>We accept returns and exchanges of new, unopened, unused, resalable products for 30 days after the original order date, subject to a 10% restocking fee.  Contact care@momi.baby if you wish to initiate a return.  </li><li>Shipping charges are nonrefundable.  Customer is responsible for return shipping costs, but we will provide a return shipping label at a discounted shipping rate.  </li><li>To help ensure the safety of every baby, we never ship products that have been opened or previously used, therefore we cannot accept returns of products that have been opened or whose packaging seal has been removed or appears tampered with.  All returned products will be inspected upon receipt prior to any refund being processed. Items that cannot be resold as new will not be refunded or shipped back to the customer.</li><li>From time to time we may offer \"happiness guarantee\" promotions.  The details of such promotions are provided at the time of such promotions.  </li><li>Products sold under certain promotions such as close-out sales or deeply discounted offers may not be eligible for return.  Please read the terms and conditions of any such promotion to determine return eligibility.  Products sold under our \"2 for $35\" promotion beginning in March 2025 are not eligible for return or for the happiness guarantee program.</li><li>In all cases we will replace products that are damaged or defective, or were shipped in error, if we are notified within 30 days of order placement.   We will cover the shipping costs for those returns.</li></ul>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_qfRNTd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "my order arrived damaged.  what do i do next?",
            "content": "<p>We take extra care to ensure all packages leave our facility in tip-top shape but know that damage can occur in transit from time to time. If your order arrives damaged, please reach out to our support team at <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\" title=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a> so we can assist. <br/></p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_q9r4TT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "i believe my mōmi bottle (or nipple) is defective.  what do i do next?",
            "content": "<p>We’re sorry you’re having trouble! The mōmi nipple involves quite a bit of complex engineering, and on rare occasions a defective one may slip through our rigorous inspection process.<br/><br/>If you believe your mōmi product may be defective, please stop using it immediately to avoid any potential safety risk to your baby. Then email us the details at <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a>. If possible, attach a photo showing the defect. We’ll work with you from there to replace any defective parts at no cost to you. At our option, we may choose to issue a refund instead of a replacement. We may require that you return the defective part (at our expense).<br/><br/>Here are some potential signs of defects that we’re aware of<br/></p><ul><li>Nipple collapses during feeding. This can be a sign that baby needs a faster flow rate, but may also occur if the vent in the nipple isn’t functioning properly to allow air back into the bottle. A vacuum forms in the bottle, eventually causing the nipple to collapse as if being sucked into the bottle. </li><li>Milk or formula drips from the anticolic vent. The vent is designed to let air in while preventing liquid from spilling out. If milk is leaking from anywhere except the central duct, please let us know.</li><li>Milk duct is malformed. The narrow milk duct that runs through the nipple’s tip should be straight and centered. A slight angle is normal and should not create any problems. If the duct is significantly off-center or has bubbles or bulged areas, that may indicate a defect.</li></ul><p><br/>Small bubbles in the tip of the nipple are normal and don’t cause a problem as long as they’re not connected to the milk duct.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_q7tbPG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "what if my baby won’t accept the mōmi bottle?",
            "content": "<p>We want you, and most importantly your baby, to love the mōmi bottle. If you or your baby is having difficulty with the mōmi bottle, our experienced team would love to help you troubleshoot by email, phone, or chat. For us, it’s not just about customer support, it’s about supporting moms.<br/><br/>Please reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\" title=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a>, by voicemail or text to 980-400-6455, or by chat here on our website.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_6kVf4p": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "how can i leave a review about the mōmi bottle?",
            "content": "<p>We would love to hear from you! You will receive a review request by email following your purchase. If you do not receive this email, please reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\" title=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a> or by voicemail or text to 980-400-6455 so we may send you a new one.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_ydThCL": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "i have a question that’s not covered here.  how can I contact you?",
            "content": "<p>Please reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a>, by chat on our website, or by voicemail or text to 980-400-6455. We usually respond within 24 hours.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        }
      },
