    "faq_yx9iji": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_B4afFq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "does mōmi offer free shipping?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we offer free shipping on purchases of at least $99. We may also occasionally offer free shipping on special purchases.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_mJjKma": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "when will my order ship?",
            "content": "<p>We understand you're eager for your order to arrive! That's why we work to fulfill orders as quickly as possible when we receive them. Most orders are fulfilled within one business day. In times of peak demand it may take more than one business day.  Our fulfillment center is closed on weekends and holidays.</p><p>When your order is fulfilled, we'll send you an email that includes a tracking number. Note that for orders shipped by Economy, it may take 1-2 business days for the carrier to scan the package into the system.</p><p>Please note that delivery times are estimated from the time of carrier pickup and exclude weekends and holidays.</p><p>Momtech cannot be responsible for delays caused by incorrect or incomplete address information, or caused by the carrier, whether due to weather, other natural causes, high demand periods, or otherwise.  We can only guarantee that the order will ship using the shipping method selected at check-out.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_c96RyB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "what are my shipping options?",
            "content": "<p>When you checkout, you'll see shipping costs for each of the following options, based on where you're located and the contents of your order. You can choose:</p><ul><li>Economy ($7.99 flat fee, or free for orders over $99) - typically arrives within 5-8 business days after carrier pick-up. Please note that packages shipped Economy may not register tracking information for 1-2 days.</li><li>UPS Ground - typically delivers one to five business days from pickup date, though delivery time is not guaranteed.  90% are delivered in three days or less.</li><li>UPS Second Day Air - typically delivers within two business days from pickup date (not including weekends and holidays).</li><li>UPS Next Day Air - most packages are delivered by 8 pm the day following carrier pickup (not including weekends and holidays).</li></ul><p>Please note that delivery times are estimated from the time of carrier pickup, and exclude weekends and holidays. Delivery times are estimates only (provided to us by the carriers).  </p><p>Momtech cannot be responsible for delays caused by incorrect or incomplete address information, or caused by the carrier, whether due to weather, other natural causes, high demand periods, or otherwise.  We can only guarantee that the order will ship using the shipping method selected at check-out.<br/><br/>UPS orders placed by 10AM Eastern Time on business days generally ship the same day. UPS orders placed after 10AM, or on weekends or holidays, generally go out the next business day. Economy-shipped orders may take 1- 2 business days for carrier pickup.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_EGCgqK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "what does shipping protection cover?",
            "content": "<p>mōmi’s fulfillment team is carefully packaging orders, but breakage or loss can sometimes happen after we deliver packages to a shipping carrier. If you purchase shipping protection for your order, we will cover the cost of replacing your items if your order should be damaged or lost en route to you. </p><p>Shipping protection applies to the products within an order, and does not guarantee a delivery date. We can only guarantee delivery to the address you provide at checkout, and reserve the right not to honor multiple claims made by the same customer or to the same shipping address.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_KfXWLB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "what if i didn’t receive my order?",
            "content": "<p>Once your order has shipped, you will be notified with a shipping confirmation email which contains tracking information for your order. You may reference this email to track your order until delivery.<br/><br/>If you believe your order may have been lost, stolen, or damaged in transit, please reach out to our support team at <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\" title=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a> so we can assist.<br/><br/>We will fully cover the cost of a replacement if your order is damaged, lost or stolen on its way to you if you pay for shipping protection at checkout.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        }
      },
