    "faq_4NhLf6": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_XeP7ki": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "how does the referral program work?",
            "content": "<p>Every person who makes a purchase from our store can join the program as a referrer. After signing up for the program you will receive a dedicated, custom link to share with your friends and network by email or social media posts. Any new customer you refer who then uses that link to complete a purchase of at least $25 from our store (excluding shipping charges and sales tax) can receive $5 off their first purchase. As the referrer, you then receive a coupon code worth $5 off your next purchase of at least $25 at our store.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_R6qpr8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "can i get credit for referring myself as a customer?",
            "content": "<p>No, you must already have made a purchase in our store to become a referrer, and the people you refer by sharing your personal link must be new customers making their first purchase in our store to receive the discount.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_kXnfNP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "is there a limit to how many referral credits i can receive?",
            "content": "<p>You may receive up to $200 in referral credits per calendar year.</p>",
