            "title": "i ordered on amazon. what flow rate did i receive?",
            "content": "<p>All customers who placed orders on Amazon received the original flow rate. The new improved flow rate nipples are available only directly from the momi.baby store.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_iXgtyB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "the original version worked well for my baby. can i purchase more of the original version?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! We saved a supply of the original version to have for customers who want to purchase more of what is already working for them. Contact <a href=\"mailto:care@momi.baby\">care@momi.baby</a>for assistance in ordering an original version.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        }
