    "faq_LBHKFi": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_9pePmB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "why does the mōmi nipple have a single duct?",
            "content": "<p>When it comes to ensuring that babies can transition from breast to bottle in the most seamless way possible, we experimented to identify the most important factor. We discovered that the baby’s ability to control the flow of milk by compressing the nipple with its tongue was the most important factor to be considered in mōmi’s nipple design.</p><p>Our nipple is solid with a single duct that allows your baby to stop the flow of milk through compression with the tongue, just as if they were breastfeeding. Hollow nipples can squirt milk out at exactly the time the baby is trying to stop the flow with the tongue, which requires babies to learn a new way of eating in order to drink from a bottle. This can result in nipple preference, bottle refusal, and regurgitation.</p><p>The single duct also makes the nipple easier to clean, making it more sanitary for baby and more practical for parents. Hooray!</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_m3iDgw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "is the mōmi bottle an “anti-colic” bottle?",
            "content": "<p>The mōmi nipple has a vent in the base designed to let air into the bottle during feeding, reducing the amount of air the baby takes in with the food. This is designed to reduce colic.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_67FQqw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "what if my baby needs a larger bottle?",
            "content": "<p>mōmi is proud to offer a larger bottle size, with a 9 oz option in lead-free glass, or 10 oz in BPA-free plastic.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_BcNdjY": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "the mōmi bottle doesn’t fit in my bottle warmer. what can i do?",
            "content": "<p>While mōmi's 5 oz bottles have a wider, bell shape that may not fit into a standard bottle warmer, they work nicely in warmers designed to hold two bottles. Reach out to our care team at care@momi.baby for more specifics! </p><p>mōmi's 4 oz and 9/10 oz bottles have a circular base, fitting in conventional single-bottle warmers.</p><p>The mōmi nipple and bottle collar are compatible with brand-name and generic standard wide-mouth bottles, including Philips Avent plastic, Chicco Duo, and Maymom, among others. Standard-shaped bottles from these manufacturers can allow you to use your mōmi nipple with a standard bottle warmer. (Please note:  we cannot ensure compatibility of the mōmi nipple with the use of a collar from another brand.)</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_N7qDTP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "is mōmi compatible with other bottles?",
            "content": "<p>The mōmi nipple and bottle collar are compatible with brand-name and generic standard wide-mouth bottles, including Philips Avent plastic, Chicco Duo and Maymom, among others.</p><p>One cost-effective option we’ve tested is the 9-ounce Maymom Wide-Mouth Milk Storage Collection Bottle with Travel Cap and Sealing Ring, available from Amazon.</p><p>Use of the mōmi nipple does require a mōmi  collar. Another another brand's collar may result in leaking or inhibit the function of the anticolic vent. If you need the nipple, cleaning tool, collar and clear cap to use mōmi on another bottle, shop our <a href=\"/products/replacement-set\" title=\"mōmi replacement set\">replacement bundles</a>. </p><p>Note: Avent is a registered trademark of Koninklijke Philips N.V. Chicco is a registered trademark of Artsana S.p.A. Maymom is a registered trademark of Maymom LLC. Momtech Inc. is not affiliated with any of these companies, nor do they endorse Momtech’s products and compatibility claims. Momtech makes no warranty regarding the quality, safety, or suitability of these companies’ products.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        },
        "item_nzehM4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "is the mōmi nipple compatible with breast pumps?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! Our plastic bottle bases are compatible with Spectra pumps and other pump systems that use standard wide-mouth bottles. We also carry a <a href=\"https://momi.baby/products/medela-pump-adaptor\" title=\"https://momi.baby/products/medela-pump-adaptor\"><strong>medela breast pump adapter</strong></a> to allow mōmi plastic bottle bases to connect to Medela breast pumps.</p><p>Note: Spectra is a registered trademark of Mother’s Milk, Inc. Medela is a registered trademark of Medela Holding AG, Switzerland. Momtech Inc. is not affiliated with any of these companies, nor do they endorse Momtech’s products and compatibility claims. Momtech makes no warranty regarding the quality, safety, or suitability of these companies’ products.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
          }
        }
      },
